 - `shipments.create_shipment(customer_id, weight_kg, zone)`: book a shipment
 - `shipments.get_shipment(shipment_id)`: fetch one shipment
+- `shipments.mark_lost(shipment_id) -> Shipment`: set a shipment's status to "lost" and emit `shipment.lost`
+  - `E_NOT_FOUND`: no shipment with that id
+  - `E_BAD_STATE`: the shipment has already been delivered
 
